{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-88","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：截差无理线段","englishTitle":"To find the fourth apotome.","book":10,"number":88,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.88","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.88/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":88,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","contentId":"euclid-10-88","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35c877bf951b368e90f6446462f78e1f224e4e3d211628beb5fb543c5c1b9f4f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-88.statement","euclid-10-88.construction.1","euclid-10-88.construction.2","euclid-10-88.construction.3","euclid-10-88.proof.1","euclid-10-88.proof.2","euclid-10-88.proof.3","euclid-10-88.proof.4","euclid-10-88.proof.5","euclid-10-88.proof.6","euclid-10-88.proof.7","euclid-10-88.proof.8","euclid-10-88.proof.9","euclid-10-88.conclusion","euclid-10-88.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-88.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c43ee01b58a98d01276d2fa4230b6d78f726c601be5192142273b07edcaa17a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the fourth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第四截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"789f2ad87f1d68bc4be8f36b9bef58820c69e91f709c6a31f84900861cd2ddce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line A be set out, and BG commensurable in length with it; therefore BG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 A美元,BG 长度可公度美元,因此BG美元也是有理美元。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1967d48d945c5e42288f1f21e5e337e75792108cea23d607c8b9bf8bc441932","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers DF, FE be set out such that the whole DE has not to either of the numbers DF, EF the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DF,FE数字 DE数字中 任何一个数字都算不上 平方数数字和平方数数字（相关点与线段：EF）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"372123e7d5f08682cae7fa9f4991ce6a3f4fc8ef383f03e19b5f14454182a3cd","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as DE is to EF, so is the square on BG to the square on GC; [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] therefore the square on BG is commensurable with the square on GC. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设DE比EF等于BG比正方形比GC比正方形,因此BG比正方形等于可公度比正方形 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)] [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f84c08a14643ac05b8b32fd31d20d46bfa3a8ba1d477f454576c745be60f05bc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on BG is rational; therefore the square on GC is also rational; therefore GC is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BG的正方形是有理;GC的正方形也是有理;GC是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c66c5897ca60739cd0d1684b6b068e85b7c4c9e5d7711d976311319bcc31b54","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since DE has not to EF the ratio which a square number has to a square number, therefore neither has the square on BG to the square on GC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BG is incommensurable in length with GC. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于DE的比例尚未达到EF,平方数的比例为平方数,平方数的比例为平方数,GC的比例为正方形,正方形的比例为正方形,GC的比例为平方数,BG的比例为不可公度,GC的比例为不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5913d84aaf875dd0d83d05ee2ee10d01ebf3f8332c4ca2ef6600c69d8b0c8f2a","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore BG, GC are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore BC is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,BG,GC是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,BC是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4941d06e4f528b02ed6f7743bfe30eff58afa83dcd9bad80ec1c8252a9a5ed17","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the square on H be that by which the square on BG is greater than the square on GC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,H正方形,就是BG正方形比GC正方形大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"95453b8ba310d3e83ff349e94f5248b1a4f794b7a442c4c882beb53c5a5ab285","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as DE is to EF, so is the square on BG to the square on GC, therefore also, convertendo, as ED is to DF, so is the square on GB to the square on H. [[v. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,DE比EF等于BG比正方形,GC比正方形,因此,转换率ED比DF等于GB比正方形比比正方形（相关点与线段：H） [[v. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e30a48e42676ae8ce7236c5829e4f15acf83ff723f24355844e1050465449086","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But ED has not to DF the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on GB to the square on H the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BG is incommensurable in length with H. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ED的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,H的比例为正方形,而GB的比例为正方形,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,BG的比例为不可公度,而H的比例为不可公度。（相关点与线段：DF） [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad3118f365683829ec1c38c494287ae410e8c30baf6faae6fbd3a5aead27ed43","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on BG is greater than the square on GC by the square on H; therefore the square on BG is greater than the square on GC by the square on a straight line incommensurable with BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG的正方形比GC的正方形还要多,H的正方形比H的正方形还要多,因此,BG的正方形比GC的正方形,不可公度和BG线上的正方形都大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f1c20826e315e6c4183116a5b0fd48f3df8178ae61b0479b34e6758057ec8a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the whole BG is commensurable in length with the rational straight line A set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"整个BG是长度可公度 有理线段、A设置。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aad4fcdbd0dc97c0e99dea117325a2c579d2a89636cd54d2a65db98629ae1a38","citations":["euclid-10-def-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BC is a fourth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以BC是第四截差无理线段 [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa20809f2a7e10e2c81bfd52c042d2e436332900e1ee64a1231e0a8078da3b4d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the fourth apotome has been found. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,第四批截差无理线段已经找到 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-88.source","contentId":"euclid-10-88","revisionId":"euclid-10-88@raw-35c877bf951b368e","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b536a46f95526cec4a6c8c6600d78e8ac34b2d7e547f14159197b809816713f8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.88/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.88\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-88:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-88","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-88.construction.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","prov